# Supabase connection for the built app.
#
# The anon key is a public, client-side key: it is compiled into the
# JavaScript that every visitor downloads, so keeping it out of the repo
# would protect nothing. What protects the data is row-level security in
# supabase/schema.sql.
#
# The service_role key is the opposite. It bypasses every policy. It must
# never appear in this file, this repo, or the browser.
